<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@/~cl_12__para_e> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for paragraph (2)(a) the following paragraph: “(2)(a) A female employee shall be entitled to receive maternity allowance for the eligible period from her employer if— (i) she has been employed by the employer for a period of, or periods amounting in the aggregate to, not less than ninety days during the nine months immediately before her confinement; and (ii) she has been employed by the employer at any time in the four months immediately before her confinement;”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@> .
