<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@/~cl_12__para_f> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(4) Any employer who terminates the service of a female employee during the period in which she is entitled to maternity leave commits an offence: Provided that for the purpose of this section, such termination shall not include termination on the ground of closure of the employer’s business.”. Amendment of section 40"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@> .
