<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@/~cl_14> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 42(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “a female employee is dismissed from her employment” the words “the service of a female employee is terminated”. New section 44a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@> .
