<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@/~cl_5__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after paragraph (da) the following paragraphs: “ (db) to enable him to purchase a computer; (dc) to enable him to pay for medical expenses for himself or his immediate family members; (dd) to enable him to pay for daily expenses pending receipt of any periodical payments for temporary disablement under the Employees’ Social Security Act 1969 [Act 4]; (de) to enable him to pay for educational expenses for himself or his immediate family members;”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@> .
