<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@/~cl_9> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 31 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “sub-contractor for labour”, wherever they may appear, the words “contractor for labour”. Amendment of Part VII"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/eng@> .
